= <span style="color: #808080;">Laval's</span> Third Government Falls !

<span style="color: #808080;">Laval's</span> Government has fallen after the <span style="color: #c7017f;">Radical</span>-dominated Senate refused his proposal for a new electoral law. <span style="color: #808080;">Laval's</span> tenure in office lasted a little more than a year.

President <span style="color: #808080;">Paul Doumer</span> decides to replace him with <span style="color: #C0A054;">André Tardieu</span>, who led the government twice in 1929-1930. Having one of our most ruthless opponents in the highest office at a time of elections hardly relieves us.